# Luma AI website

This is a responsive, static AI product website built with HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. It has no build step, backend, chatbot, API key, or package dependencies.

## View the website

Open `index.html` in a web browser. For the best result, use a current browser and an internet connection for the optional Google Fonts.

The main navigation links scroll to each section. The use-case buttons switch the feature panel, the FAQ rows expand, and the contact button opens an email draft.

## Before publishing

The contact link uses `hello@yourdomain.com` as an example. Replace that address in `index.html` with your real contact email before publishing. All illustrations are made from HTML and CSS; there are no image placeholders or third-party image dependencies.

This phase is the website frontend only. The page does not include an AI chat assistant or an OpenAI API connection.
